# Lemonade that changes colour: an indicator measures the liquid
# Bromothymol blue uses one computed spectrum in a basic control and lemon acid.
# The named juice is a surrogate; do not taste laboratory mixtures.
register lv1
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 NaOH 0.001mol
add v1 bromothymol_blue 0.00001mol
look v1
new beaker
add v2 lemon_juice 100mL
add v2 bromothymol_blue 0.00001mol
look v2
measure v2 ph
